6. Conclusion
Different manufacturing processes produce different surface characteristics. Also, different applications require different surface properties. Surface parameters are therefore different and wide-ranging. Each of these parameters indicates a particular property of the surface and it could be the most important for the particular application. This research presented the definitions and the mathematical formulae for about 59 of the surface roughness parameters. This collection of surface roughness parameter was used in a new software computer vision package called SurfVision developed by the authors. In the package, these definitions were extended to calculate the 3D surface topography of different specimens.
